{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03163","headline":"自始兴溪夜上赴岭 · 张九龄","name":"自始兴溪夜上赴岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝蓄名山意，兹爲世网牵。\n征途屡及此，初服已非然。\n日落青岩际，溪行绿筱边。\n去舟乘月後，归鸟息人前。\n数曲迷幽嶂，连圻触闇泉。\n深林风绪结，遥夜客情悬。\n非梗胡爲泛，无膏亦自煎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}